    "I have no idea where he is these days. But his cousin Charlie in Varrock may know. You should talk to him. He's normally somewhere near the Blue Moon Inn.": 590,
    "I'm afraid this is the end of the road for you, Blurite Rock. This ruin is about to become your tomb.": 589,
