    "Try not to blow the entire mountain up this time...": 588,
    "We had a falling out after a, uhm... dig, went wrong.": 592,
    "We'll need something stronger. Who knows what could be inside the ruins. There could be traps, or even monsters!": 556,
    "We're not a team of archaeologist, you idiot. We're grave robbers looking for their next score.": 589,
    "What was that noise?": 571,
    "Whats happening?!": 596,
